This was shipped in v2.1.80 (March 19, 2026)! 🎉😭

The `rate_limits` field is now available in statusLine JSON with `five_hour` and `seven_day` windows:

```json
{
  "rate_limits": {
    "five_hour": {
      "used_percentage": 42.3,
      "resets_at": "2026-03-20T15:00:00Z"
    },
    "seven_day": {
      "used_percentage": 85.7,
      "resets_at": "2026-03-24T00:00:00Z"
    }
  }
}
```

I wrote up 5 visual patterns for displaying it: https://nyosegawa.com/posts/claude-code-statusline-rate-limi
